    {
      "id": "t_000001",
      "topic": "trad-culture",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "zh": "剪纸是中国最受欢迎的民间艺术之一，已有超过一千五百年的历史。",
      "reference": "Paper-cutting is one of the most popular folk arts in China, with a history of more than 1,500 years.",
