    {
      "id": "t_000003",
      "topic": "trad-culture",
      "difficulty": 3,
      "zh": "京剧集歌唱、舞蹈和武术于一体，是中国最具代表性的戏曲形式。",
      "reference": "Peking opera combines singing, dancing and martial arts, making it the most representative form of Chinese opera.",
