      "hints": [
        "得分点：强调 / ……之间的和谐 / 人与自然 / 数千年",
        "「和谐」是 harmony；「……之间」用 between … and …",
        "句型：Traditional Chinese medicine emphasizes … and has been practiced for …"
      ],
      "topicWords": [
        "traditional Chinese medicine",
        "harmony",
        "nature"
      ],
      "source": "authored"
    },
    {
      "id": "t_000005",
      "topic": "trad-culture",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "zh": "太极拳不仅是一种武术，也是一种深受欢迎的健身方式。",
      "reference": "Tai chi is not only a form of martial art but also a popular way of keeping fit.",
