      "hints": [
        "得分点：不仅 / 也／而且 / 武术 / 健身",
        "「不仅……而且……」用 not only … but also …；「健身」可用 keep fit",
        "句型：Tai chi is not only … but also …"
      ],
      "topicWords": [
        "tai chi",
        "martial art",
        "keep fit"
      ],
      "source": "authored"
