    {
      "id": "t_000006",
      "topic": "trad-culture",
      "difficulty": 3,
      "zh": "瓷器发明于中国，早在唐代就已远销海外。",
      "reference": "Porcelain was invented in China and was exported to overseas markets as early as the Tang Dynasty.",
      "keyPoints": [
        {
          "id": "kp1",
          "head": "invented in",
          "zh": "发明于",
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "kp2",
          "head": "exported to",
          "zh": "远销到",
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "kp3",
          "head": "as early as",
          "zh": "早在",
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "kp4",
          "head": "overseas markets",
          "zh": "海外（市场）",
          "weight": 2
        }
      ],
      "hints": [
        "得分点：发明于 / 远销到 / 早在 / 海外（市场）",
        "两个动作都用被动语态；「远销海外」意译为 be exported to overseas markets；「唐代」可用 the Tang Dynasty",
        "句型：Porcelain was invented in … and was exported to … as early as …"
      ],
      "topicWords": [
        "porcelain",
        "export",
        "Tang Dynasty"
      ],
      "source": "authored"
    },
    {
      "id": "t_000007",
      "topic": "trad-culture",
      "difficulty": 3,
      "zh": "中国园林讲究自然之美，力求达到人工与自然的完美统一。",
      "reference": "Chinese gardens emphasize the beauty of nature and strive to achieve a perfect harmony between human design and the natural world.",
